### Criar primeira tarefa
POST https://localhost:7291/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "c720c6da-e5e0-4ae8-beb4-c8a368df2281",
  "title": "Implementar autenticação JWT",
  "description": "Adicionar autenticação JWT à API TaskFlow",
  "priority": 3,
  "dueDate": null
}

### Buscar tarefa pelo ID
GET https://localhost:7291/api/tasks/d08f7eb9-b4cd-4da4-9276-1d59845e28a1
Accept: application/json

### Listar todas as tarefas
GET https://localhost:7291/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Listar tarefas de um projeto específico
GET https://localhost:7291/api/tasks/project/c720c6da-e5e0-4ae8-beb4-c8a368df2281
Accept: application/json

### Atualizar tarefa existente
PUT https://localhost:7291/api/tasks/d08f7eb9-b4cd-4da4-9276-1d59845e28a1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Implementar JWT com Refresh Token",
  "description": "Criar login, geração de tokens e renovação de autenticação",
  "priority": 4,
  "dueDate": null
}

### Verificar atualização da tarefa
GET https://localhost:7291/api/tasks/d08f7eb9-b4cd-4da4-9276-1d59845e28a1
Accept: application/json

### Iniciar tarefa
PATCH https://localhost:7291/api/tasks/d08f7eb9-b4cd-4da4-9276-1d59845e28a1/start
Accept: application/json

### Concluir tarefa
PATCH https://localhost:7291/api/tasks/d08f7eb9-b4cd-4da4-9276-1d59845e28a1/complete
Accept: application/json

### Testar cancelamento de tarefa concluída
PATCH https://localhost:7291/api/tasks/d08f7eb9-b4cd-4da4-9276-1d59845e28a1/cancel
Accept: application/json

### Criar tarefa para testar cancelamento
POST https://localhost:7291/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "c720c6da-e5e0-4ae8-beb4-c8a368df2281",
  "title": "Configurar envio de e-mails",
  "description": "Implementar notificações por e-mail no TaskFlow",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": null
}

### Cancelar tarefa pendente
PATCH https://localhost:7291/api/tasks/0a1c5400-7251-41ab-a295-732597f7cb0a/cancel
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar primeiro usuário
POST https://localhost:7291/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuário Teste",
  "email": "teste@example.com"
}

